      19. According to the judgment of the researcher, the patients have other factors that may lead to the forced termination of this study, such as other serious diseases (including mental diseases) requiring combined treatment, severe laboratory test abnormalities, accompanied by family or social factors, which will affect the safety of the subjects, or the collection of data.
